graph TD
    accTitle: Asynchronous Job Polling State Loop
    accDescr: Flowchart showing JobPoller checking job status until reaching a terminal state or raising JobTimeoutError
    A["start run()"] --> B[get job status]
    B --> C{terminal state?}
    C -- Yes --> D[return status]
    C -- No --> E{timeout exceeded?}
    E -- Yes --> F[raise JobTimeoutError]
    E -- No --> G[sleep interval]
    G --> B
